{
  "dom_id": "question-334711",
  "name": null,
  "problem": "The local truncation error (LTE) of a numerical method with step size $Δx$ is\n\n$$\nτ(Δx)=3(Δx)^{3}+2(Δx)^{4}.\n$$\n\nComplete the following sentences.\n\n$\\,$ With step size $Δx=0.8,$ the local truncation error is $≈$\n{{field-1}}.\n\n$\\,$ With step size $Δx=0.2,$ the local truncation error is $≈$\n{{field-2}}.\n\n$\\,$ Decreasing from $Δx=0.8$ to $Δx=0.2,$ the LTE is reduced by a factor of $≈$\n{{field-3}}.\n\n$\\,$ According to this data, the order of the method is approximately\n{{field-4}}.",
